data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Off-target risks missing:** The review never mentions unintended cuts at other DNA sites, a central limitation for any therapeutic use.\n- **Single-source applications:** The claims about disease models and rapid diagnostics rest on one source, so they need corroboration.\n- **Mechanism unexplained:** It says breaking a gene causes a knockout but omits the repair pathways (such as NHEJ versus HDR) that determine the outcome."}

